Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4933730,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-4933730","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:16Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4933730,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-4933730","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:16Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4933730,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4933730-1841579228677236","game_id":"steam-4933730","kind":"update","title":"Patch 0.01.05: Heroes' new looks","summary":"DEVLOG — Update 0.01.05Dear Handslayers,Update 0.01.05 focuses on many improves throughout the game:- Improved Trigger Phase for enemies' abilities better interact with player.- Re-worked the ability system so that every ability now works in a more smooth flow.- Fix a bug that items can be used during Trigger Phase.- Update graphics all heroes and enemies.- Many other bug fixes & improvements.Jump into the updated demo and experience the improvements.As always, thank you for playing and for the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T04:05:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228677236","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4933730-1840944183785206","game_id":"steam-4933730","kind":"update","title":"Patch 0.01.04: Enemies Fight Back","summary":"DEVLOG — Update 0.01.04Dear Handslayers,Update 0.01.04 expands how enemies interact with the player, introduces a progression resource for hero re-rolls, improves battle readability, and brings a large visual and audio pass to Handslayer.The main focus of this update is making enemy abilities feel like actions happening on the battlefield. Instead of their effects silently appearing in the calculations, CPU abilities now have a dedicated Trigger Phase with clearer timing, presentation, and feedb","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T06:00:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183785206","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4933730-1840310314350514","game_id":"steam-4933730","kind":"update","title":"Major Update Live: Party of 3 Heroes","summary":"Hey Handslayers,The big update is here.We’ve completely overhauled how runs work. What used to be a single-character adventure is now a full party experience.What’s newParty of 3 Heroes: You no longer start a run with just one character. You now embark with a party of 3 heroes.Lane Swapping: During battle you can freely swap lanes between your heroes. Positioning now matters.New Heroes + Roles: A large number of new heroes have been added. Every hero now has a clear role:TankAssassinMageWarriorV","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T07:26:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314350514","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4933730-1839676055884047","game_id":"steam-4933730","kind":"update","title":"Big Update Incoming: From Solo Character to Party of 3","summary":"Dear Handslayers,We’re making a big change.After watching how people play the demo, one thing became clear: a lot of you are finishing runs too quickly. The core loop is fun, the builds feel good, but the runs themselves don’t last long enough.So we’re adjusting the foundation.What’s changing Instead of controlling 1 character per run, you’ll now select and build a party of 3 characters.Why we’re doing thisRuns will be meaningfully longer and deeperSynergies between characters will matter a lot ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T02:46:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055884047","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4933730-1839676055881361","game_id":"steam-4933730","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Day 1: Every Hand (feedback) Matters","summary":"Hey Handslayers!The demo has been live for a full day, and we’re honestly a bit speechless.Thank you.Whether you jumped straight into your first three-hand duel, spent an hour theorycrafting relic + suit synergies, left a feedback, or just quietly wishlisted the full game — every single one of you means a lot to a small team.Small update coming soon!We’re preparing a quick UI/UX pass based on the first day’s feedback:Clearer visual difference between winning and losing lanesNew Help popup that e","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-29T02:29:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055881361","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4933730-1839041357037229","game_id":"steam-4933730","kind":"announcement","title":"Handslayer Demo Available Now!","summary":"The Handslayer Demo is live!Forget traditional poker. In Handslayer, every battle is a tactical three-hand duel.Carefully arrange your cards, predict your opponent’s moves, and outplay them with clever synergies. Specialize in the four suits (Hearts, Diamonds, Clubs, Spades), collect powerful relics, choose risky Ancient Artifacts, and forge game-breaking builds through a deep skill tree.What you can do in the demo:Experience the unique three-hand combat systemDiscover relics and build powerful ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-28T02:57:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357037229","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4933730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:31:08Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:31:08Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4933730":"2026-10-26T05:31:08Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4933730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:31:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:31:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4966800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:31:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:31:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4933730","app_id":4933730,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:09Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"fd6ac5edca255c09c308fccf2137